  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentInBusinessCombinationsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 2024년 11월 26일 DYNA-MAC Holdings Ltd. 및 DYNA-MAC Holdings Ltd.의 종속법인과 2024년 12월 26일 한화오션㈜ 및 한화오션㈜의 종속기업, 2024년 12월 31일HANWHA PHILLY SHIPYARD INC.를 사업결합을 통하여 연결범위에 포함하였습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentInBusinessCombinationsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfNonProratedAmountsRelatedToPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 2024년 9월 1일 시큐리티사업과 산업용장비사업을 인적분할하여 한화인더스트리얼솔루션즈㈜를 설립하였으며, 회사가 보유하고 있는 한화비전㈜, 한화정밀기계㈜, 한화테크윈(천진)유한공사 그리고 한화상업설비(상해)유한공사의 유형자산을 승계하였습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfNonProratedAmountsRelatedToPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfDepreciationPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">전기 중 인적분할한 시큐리티사업과 산업용장비사업의 감가상각비가 포함되어 있습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfDepreciationPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfIncreaseDecreaseThroughTransfersAndOtherChangesPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">본계정대체 및 환율변동효과 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfIncreaseDecreaseThroughTransfersAndOtherChangesPropertyPlantAndEquipmentOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutPropertyPlantAndEquipmentLineItemsOfDisclosureOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTableOfItems>
