  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfExpiryDateOfTemporaryDifferencesUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCredits contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 연결회사가 종속기업 투자지분과 관련하여 소멸시점을 통제할 수 있고 예측가능한 미래에 일시적차이가 소멸하지 않을 가능성이 높아 이연법인세부채를인식하지 않은 가산할 일시적차이는 없습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfExpiryDateOfTemporaryDifferencesUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCredits>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">이사회 결의를 통하여 연결회사의 주요 임원에게 양도제한조건부주식(이하, RSU)을 부여하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기준주식: 한화에어로스페이스 주식회사 보통주식</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <entity00126566:TotalGrantAmountShareValueLinkedCashOfDescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="0">5028327450</entity00126566:TotalGrantAmountShareValueLinkedCashOfDescriptionOfMethodOfSettlementForShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems>
  <entity00126566:ExercisePriceShareOptionsGrantedOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">현행 주식기준보상제도는 행사가격이 없음</entity00126566:ExercisePriceShareOptionsGrantedOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2025-01-01, 중도 부여 임직원은 개별 계약 조건에 따라 부여시점과 부여기준주가를 확정하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">가득조건: 당해년도 해당 보직에서 6개월 이상 근무하는 경우, 부여된 RSU를 조정하지 않음
행사가능시점: RSU에 대한 지급효력은 임직원의 재직여부와 관계없이, 각 임직원에 따라 2027년 1월부터 2035년 3월까지개별 조건에 따라 발생(단, 중도지급조건에 해당하는 경우, 회사는 임원에게 이를 지급할 수 있음)</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00126566_SharesSubjectToTransferRestrictionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">이사회 결의를 통하여 연결회사의 주요 임원에게 양도제한조건부주식(이하, RSU)을 부여하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
