  <entity00126566:AmountsPayableRelatedPartyTransactionsUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_HanwhaAviationPteLtdOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember" unitRef="USD" decimals="-3">168000000</entity00126566:AmountsPayableRelatedPartyTransactionsUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_HanwhaAviationPteLtdOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember" xml:lang="ko">2025년 7월 31일 Hanwha Aviation Pte Ltd.는 연결회사의 연대 보증(채무금액의 120%)을 통해 하나은행(싱가폴),KEXIM(싱가폴), 농협은행(홍콩)으로부터 각 8천만, 3천만, 3천만 총 1.4억 USD 한도의 차입 계약을 체결하였습니다. 이에 대해 2025년 7월 31일 연결회사는 Hanwha Impact Partners Inc.와 주주간 협약서를 체결하여 지분 비율인 50:50의 비율로 보증 분담하는 별도의 계약을 맺고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
