  <entity00126566:ProvisionOfGuaranteesOrCollateralToEntityRelatedPartyTransactionsUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00126566_SameNetherlandsBVOfJointVenturesWhereEntityIsVenturerMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00126566_ProvidedPerformanceGuaranteeMemberOfTypesOfPaymentGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" unitRef="USD" decimals="-3">2517811000</entity00126566:ProvisionOfGuaranteesOrCollateralToEntityRelatedPartyTransactionsUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
