  <entity00126566:DescriptionOfSpinOffFairValueMeasurementAndLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfChangesInLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValueClassifiedAsLevel3OfFairValueMeasurementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfChangesInLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValueClassifiedAsLevel3OfFairValueMeasurementTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_MeasurementAxis_ifrs-full_AtFairValueMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfLiabilitiesAxis_dart_DerivativeLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 2024년 9월 1일 시큐리티사업과 산업용장비사업을 인적분할하여 한화인더스트리얼솔루션즈㈜ 설립하였으며, 회사가 보유하고 있는 한화비전㈜, 한화정밀기계㈜, 한화테크윈(천진)유한공사 그리고 한화상업설비(상해)유한공사의 금융자산을 승계하였습니다.</entity00126566:DescriptionOfSpinOffFairValueMeasurementAndLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfChangesInLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValueClassifiedAsLevel3OfFairValueMeasurementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfChangesInLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValueClassifiedAsLevel3OfFairValueMeasurementTableOfItems>
